/**
 * Billing & Revenue (source L22599–L23823, v61): domain core (integer money, documents, state machines, payments,
 * numbering, permissions, audit), synthetic demonstration data, the application shell (navigation, pages, drawers,
 * dialogs, tables), the A4 document renderer and editor, reporting, catalogue and configuration.
 *
 * Deliberate structure (ADR-04 exception, as for HR & Payroll): the source builds the app from string templates written
 * with innerHTML and patched in place. It is ported as a typed imperative island that fills the `.bi` container the
 * window body mounts once. The code below is the source's own text (templates are byte-identical) with types added;
 * only the OS integration (L23790–L23806) is replaced by the React window wiring (src/apps/billing/BillingApp.tsx).
 *
 * Simulated as in the source (S class): roles and permissions are a browser-side demo; every person, price and
 * organisation is fictitious; no payment provider, e-invoicing platform or official tariff base is connected.
 */
